## Pipeline Demonstration

### End-to-End Airflow Orchestration

![Airflow DAG overview](docs/images/airflow-dags-overview.png)

*The Airflow environment shows successful `fred_ingest`, `fred_warehouse`, and `fred_reports` workflows, demonstrating automated movement from ingestion through reporting.*

### Dynamic Task Mapping

![Dynamic task mapping](docs/images/dynamic-task-mapping.png)

*Airflow dynamically created an independent fetch task for each configured economic indicator, allowing the pipeline to process multiple FRED series efficiently.*

### Bronze and Silver Validation

![Bronze and Silver validation](docs/images/bronze-silver-validation.png)

*DuckDB validation confirmed that HOUST landed with 813 observations and was standardized as a monthly series covering January 1959 through September 2026.*

### Gold Series Dimension

![Gold series dimension](docs/images/gold-series-dimension.png)

*The Gold warehouse assigned stable analytical keys to the configured indicators, with HOUST receiving `series_key = 9` after the dimension rebuild.*

### Quarterly Fact Validation

